# What the Vercel CLI must NOT upload when deploying from this laptop.
#
# Added 26 Sep 2026 after finding src/.env inside the stored source of the live deployment
# (dpl_AQyM6qXZnRy6ugM4cH5WhTFT8Ltz, 25 Sep 12:48). The CLI does not read .gitignore, so
# every `vercel --prod` shipped the local .env to Vercel. Vercel keeps deployment source
# private to the team, but a file of settings has no business being there: the build reads
# its VITE_* values from Project Settings > Environment Variables instead (see
# 07-website/GO-LIVE-IDEOVENT-IN.md step 4.1). Set those BEFORE the first deploy that
# carries this file, or the admin passcode and the EmailJS ids fall back to defaults.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Built output and dependencies are produced on Vercel's own machines.
node_modules
dist
dist-ssr

# Local-only material.
_unpublished
screenshots-src
scripts/.tmp
*.log
